{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"device level network health assessment device level network health assessment","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","fileName":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Network Monitoring and Remediation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"device level network health assessment device level network health assessment","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","fileName":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment","heading":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A device-level network health assessment keeps findings attached to a specific router, switch, or firewall instead of reducing all telemetry to one fleet status. It can state which metric is abnormal, how far it is from a threshold, and what nearby evidence supports investigation.\n\nDevice role changes interpretation: high connection count means something different on a firewall than on an access switch. Location and interface count also provide context. An overall summary should be derived from these traceable assessments so an engineer can move from a headline back to the exact observations.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"device level network health assessment device level network health assessment","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","fileName":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Device-Level Network Health Assessment","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}